--- !u!114 &1781365618
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1781365615}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1549417ae4b143a488f76dac35a6947b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::RuneLibrary
  runes:
  - runeId: 101
    runeName: Life Rune
    runeType: 1
    rarity: 0
    description: A rune born from life force. It strengthens the body and converts
      vitality into healing, damage, shields, and growth.
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    displayPrefab: {fileID: 0}
    tier1Effect: When you kill a monster, gain 1 Life Attribute Soul and 1 Life Recovery
      Soul.
    tier2Effect: When you cast a skill, restore HP equal to 5% of your max HP. This
      can trigger once per skill cast.
    tier3Effect: After casting a skill, the first enemy hit takes bonus damage equal
      to 5% of your max HP. This can trigger once per skill cast.
    tier4Effect: If healing from Life Rune effects overheals you, the overflow is
      converted into permanent shield. Permanent shield does not decay over time
      and is capped at 100% of your max HP.
    tier5Effect: Max HP increased by 50%.
    setBonusEffect: Life Awakening. Gain all-stat bonuses based on max HP. Every
      10 max HP counts as 1 Life Attribute. All stats except HP are increased by
      10% of that Life Attribute value, rounded down.
  - runeId: 102
    runeName: Shield Rune
    runeType: 2
    rarity: 0
    description: A rune formed from protective will. It builds shields when you avoid
      damage and converts shield power into stronger defense and offense.
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    displayPrefab: {fileID: 0}
    tier1Effect: After not taking monster damage for 3 seconds, refill your current
      shield up to 50% of your max HP.
    tier2Effect: While you have a shield, your damage dealt is increased by 30%.
    tier3Effect: When you kill a monster, gain 1 Shield Soul.
    tier4Effect: Shield gained is increased by 100%.
    tier5Effect: After casting a skill, the first enemy hit takes bonus damage equal
      to 15% of your current shield. This can trigger once per skill cast. This damage
      is affected by Shield Efficiency.
    setBonusEffect: Guardian Ascension. Shield cap is increased to 300% of your max
      HP. Each time you kill an elite monster or Boss, shield efficiency is permanently
      increased by 10%, up to 300%.
  - runeId: 103
    runeName: Mana Rune
    runeType: 3
    rarity: 0
    description: A rune condensed from pure mana. It expands mana capacity, strengthens
      Mana Soul recovery, and converts extra mana consumption into stronger skill
      effects and growth.
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    displayPrefab: {fileID: 0}
    tier1Effect: Max Mana increased by 200.
    tier2Effect: Mana regeneration speed increased by 150%.
    tier3Effect: When you kill a monster, an additional Mana Soul drops. If Mana
      Soul recovery overflows your mana, the overflow is converted into Mana Overflow.
      Mana Overflow is capped at 200% of your max mana.
    tier4Effect: When you cast a skill, additionally consume up to 20% of your max
      mana from Mana Overflow first, then normal mana. Based on the actual extra
      consumed ratio, that skill's core effect is strengthened up to its own configured
      cap. This can trigger once per skill cast.
    tier5Effect: Gain all-stat bonuses based on max mana. Every 10 max mana counts
      as 1 Mana Attribute. All stats except HP and MP are increased by 10% of that
      Mana Attribute value, affected by Mana Conversion Efficiency and rounded down.
    setBonusEffect: Mana Ascension. Mana Soul recovery becomes 400% of its original
      value, Mana Overflow cap is increased to 300% of max mana, and each elite monster
      or Boss kill permanently increases Mana Conversion Efficiency by 10%, up to
      300%.
  - runeId: 104
    runeName: Thorn Rune
    runeType: 4
    rarity: 0
    description: A rune born from pain and the will to counterattack. It reduces
      incoming damage and converts attacks received into retaliatory power.
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    displayPrefab: {fileID: 0}
    tier1Effect: Monster damage taken is reduced by 25%.
    tier2Effect: When hit by a monster, deal Thorn damage to the attacker. Base Thorn
      damage is (10% of max HP + Physical Attack + Physical Defense + Special Attack
      + Special Defense + Speed + Luck) x 30%.
    tier3Effect: Thorn damage increased by 100%.
    tier4Effect: After casting a skill, the first time that skill deals damage, add
      bonus damage equal to 150% of your current Thorn damage. This can trigger once
      per skill cast.
    tier5Effect: When hit by a monster, automatically release Thorn Counter. Thorn
      Counter creates a thorn burst centered on you, damages enemies in range for
      300% of your current Thorn damage, always includes the attacker, has its own
      cooldown, and does not trigger other auto-cast effects.
    setBonusEffect: Pain Backlash. Thorn damage is additionally increased by 100%,
      Thorn Counter cooldown is reduced to 2 seconds, and each elite monster or Boss
      kill permanently increases Thorn Efficiency by 10%, up to 300%.
  - runeId: 105
    runeName: Luck Rune
    runeType: 5
    rarity: 0
    description: A rune condensed from the breath of fate. It improves Soul acquisition
      efficiency and turns chance-based combat rewards into long-term growth.
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    displayPrefab: {fileID: 0}
    tier1Effect: Luck increased by 5.
    tier2Effect: When a monster drops an Attribute Soul, there is a 30% chance to
      increase that Soul's point value by 1, up to a maximum of 5.
    tier3Effect: When you kill a monster, there is a 25% chance to drop 1 additional
      random Attribute Soul.
    tier4Effect: When you pick up any Soul, there is a 20% chance to copy 1 Soul
      of the same type. The copied Soul has a fixed value of 2 points.
    tier5Effect: When you kill an elite monster or Boss, drop 5 additional random
      Attribute Souls.
    setBonusEffect: Fate's Favor. All Luck Rune probability effects have their base
      trigger rates multiplied by 1.5. Each elite monster or Boss kill permanently
      increases Luck Efficiency by 10%, up to 500%.
  keepCustomText: 0
